-3.  **Sheet Buffer:** A 2D accumulator buffer aligned with the volume axis most parallel to the image plane [S1, unofficial]. It stores intermediate $(R,G,B,\alpha)$ values for a slice of voxels [S6, unofficial].
-4.  **Compositing Buffer:** The final working image buffer where sheet buffers are composited [S6, unofficial].
